AntennaTimeMin -250.00 ns
AntennaTimeMax 750.00 ns
ExpectedXmaxDist 177562.14 m
######################################################################################

#Skeleton ##############################################################

#A GRAND SHOWER SKELETON
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#AIRES-Specific Section

PropagatePrimary On

#Configure the site
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Define a new site (note that the Ground Altitude will be overriden if the GroundAlitude directive is used)
AddSite Xiaodushan 40.99 deg 93.94 deg 1264.00 m
# Select the new site
Site Xiaodushan
#Seting the magnetic field (if it is not set manually, it will look in IGRF13
GeomagneticField 56.482 uT 61.6 deg 0.1253 deg
#Setting the date is irrelevant if we manually set the Magnetic Field, but if not, is used to get the magnetic field for that date
Date 2022 10 26

#Configure the atmosphere
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
AddAtmosModel &EOMD
##Custom ZHAireS Atmosphere taken from GDAS using gdastool 
#    Coordinates: lat = +40.14 deg, lon = +94.66 deg  
#     Time [UTC]: Sat Apr  1 12:00:00 2017 
#
  AtmIdent ChaoDunhuang

  AtmName DunhuangFromChao

  AtmDefault Linsley

  AddLayer 0.0000E+00 km  3.6888E+00 km  1.1766E+00 kg/m3  8.3329E-01 kg/m3
  AddLayer 3.6888E+00 km  9.3776E+00 km  8.3329E-01 kg/m3  4.6029E-01 kg/m3
  AddLayer 9.3776E+00 km  2.6300E+01 km  4.6029E-01 kg/m3  4.0212E-02 kg/m3
  AddLayer 2.6300E+01 km  1.0000E+02 km  4.0212E-02 kg/m3  1.2600E-06 kg/m3
End
&EOMD
Atmosphere ChaoDunhuang
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------

#Set up thinning.
Thinning 1E-5 Rel
#This is the optimal WF for zhaires
ThinningWFactor 0.06
#ZHAireS only supports TotalShowers 1
TotalShowers 1

#Table Export
# increase the number of observing levels 
#(more detailed longitudinal files, at the expense of a bigger idf data file)
ObservingLevels 510 100.000 km 1.264 km
#set the limits of radial tables (a bit useless in inclined showers)
RLimsTables 100 m 20 km

#dont save ground or lgtpcles if you wont use them (waste space)
SaveNotInFile lgtpcles All
SaveNotInFile grdpcles All

#This is for the job to finish before it runs out of wall time in Lyon (48hs)
MaxCpuTimePerRun 120 min
RunsPerProcess 23
#This is to make Aires use the local $TMPDIR for the Scratch. 
#This will speed up the simulation and reduce the load on sps
Import TMPDIR
FileDirectory Scratch {TMPDIR}

#Speed up sims for radio
#increase the energy threshold up to 1MeV (%saves up to 30% of cpu time)
ElectronCutEnergy 1 MeV
ElectronRoughCut 1 MeV
GammaCutEnergy 1 MeV
GammaRoughCut 1 MeV

#ZHAireS-Specific Section 
#(ZHAireS directives are ignored with warnings by Aires, or if ZHAireS Off)
# Reduce the size of old .dat output
# leaving only antena number, time and electric field components
ReducedDATOutput On
#Creates an additional CoREAS compatible output
CoREASOutput On
#The Antenna time window is set by the antenna positions generator.
#Here we set only the time bin. This is a safe time bin to go to 250Mhz.
#Nyquist criteria would say this is safe to 1GHz...but ZHAireS is an integrator.
#not a sample and hold logic.
TimeDomainBin 0.50 ns
#

End
